## 🚀 Getting Started Locally (Without Docker)

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/deepakbadnaware/hotel-management-system.git
cd hotel-management-system

# Backend
cd server
npm install
npm start

# Frontend (new terminal)
cd client
npm install
npm start
```

