## ✨ Application Features

- 🔐 Role-based authentication (Admin / Staff / Guest)
- 🛏️ Room booking, availability, and check-in/check-out management
- 💳 Payment/billing module
- 📊 Admin dashboard with occupancy analytics
- 🔍 Search & filter rooms by type, price, availability
- 📧 Email notifications for booking confirmation

---

## 🎯 Key DevOps Highlights (TL;DR for Recruiters)

- ✅ **Fully automated CI/CD** — code push to production deployment with zero manual steps
- ✅ **Infrastructure as Code** — entire cloud environment reproducible via Terraform
- ✅ **Shift-left security** — Trivy scans block vulnerable images from shipping
- ✅ **Quality gates** — SonarQube enforces code health before merge
- ✅ **Container orchestration** — self-healing, auto-scaling Kubernetes deployment
- ✅ **Immutable infrastructure** — every deployment is a fresh, versioned container image

